        <briefdescription>
<para>Convert a double to a string. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Internal helper. The output matches the former ostk::core::type::Real::toString() output, except that NaN prints as &quot;NaN&quot; (there is no undefined double): infinities print as &quot;+Inf&quot; / &quot;-Inf&quot;, integral values keep a trailing &quot;.0&quot;, and other values use the round-trip representation without trailing zeros.</para>
